# Numerical native body impacts. BODY_IMPACT_DAMAGE=0 keeps ordinary animated falls and spell damage.
# Falls check torso contact speed against sqrt(2gh) within 10%; animated HP is a reference.
# Ragdoll damping remains unchanged; damage is checked against damageFall at the measured speed.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
release all
overlay off
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
wait 500
clear 3000
body-impact setup fall 2
wait 800
body-impact launch
rec fall-2 novideo
wait 4000
body-impact report
stop
body-impact setup fall 5
wait 800
body-impact launch
rec fall-5 novideo
wait 4000
body-impact report
stop
body-impact setup fall 10
wait 800
body-impact launch
rec fall-10 novideo
wait 4000
body-impact report
stop
body-impact setup wall 6
wait 800
body-impact launch
rec wall-6 novideo
wait 1000
body-impact report
stop
body-impact setup wall 10
wait 800
body-impact launch
rec wall-10 novideo
wait 1000
body-impact report
stop
body-impact setup wall 14
wait 800
body-impact launch
rec wall-14 novideo
wait 1000
body-impact report
stop
body-impact setup fatal 14
wait 800
body-impact launch
rec wall-fatal novideo
wait 1200
body-impact report
stop
body-impact setup unconscious 10
wait 800
body-impact launch
rec unconscious-10 novideo
wait 2300
body-impact report
stop
body-impact setup dead 10
wait 800
body-impact launch
rec dead-10 novideo
wait 2300
body-impact report
stop
body-impact setup immortal 10
wait 800
body-impact launch
rec immortal-10 novideo
wait 2300
body-impact report
stop
# An unscaled goblin has its original 18 kg mass: a real WindFist can exceed its 5 m fall threshold.
body-impact wind
wait 600
spell equip 26
wait 1200
spell case body-impact-wind
rec real-wind-goblin novideo
spell cast 600
wait 4500
body-impact report
stop
body-impact clear
